**AIService**

Defined in `proto/api/v1/ai_service.proto:11-20`:

```proto
service AIService {
  // Transcribe transcribes an audio file using an instance AI provider.
  rpc Transcribe(TranscribeRequest) returns (TranscribeResponse) {
    option (google.api.http) = {
      post: "/api/v1/ai:transcribe"
      body: "*"
    };
    option (google.api.method_signature) = "audio";
  }
}
```

`Transcribe` is `AIService`'s only RPC. It maps to `POST /api/v1/ai:transcribe` in the REST gateway, takes a `TranscribeRequest` wrapping a required `TranscriptionAudio audio` field (`proto/api/v1/ai_service.proto:22-25`), and transcribes via the configured instance AI provider. Generated stubs land in `proto/gen/api/v1/ai_service_grpc.pb.go` and `proto/gen/api/v1/apiv1connect/ai_service.connect.go`.

